00:16:44,431 --> 00:16:44,781
おお！
Oh!

131
00:16:44,941 --> 00:16:50,211
で普通に夢中になってて、あの降りるトコも乗り過ぎました！
And I was totally absorbed in it, and I even missed my stop to get off!

132
00:16:50,341 --> 00:16:50,631
おお！
Oh!

133
00:16:50,961 --> 00:16:53,331
そんな夢中になって聞いてくれてたんですか？
You were listening to it that engrossed?

134
00:16:53,411 --> 00:16:56,271
いや本当にめちゃくちゃ綺麗です！
Yeah, really, it was super gorgeous!

135
00:16:56,321 --> 00:17:00,111
本当に一緒にカイライ歌ってできて本当に嬉しいです！
I'm really so happy we could sing "Kairai" together!

136
00:17:00,211 --> 00:17:06,931
いやこちらこそ本当に、もう素敵な機械をいただいて、まさかこのカイライを選択してもらえると思ってなくて、
No, I'm the one who's truly grateful to receive such a wonderful opportunity, never thinking you'd choose "Kairai,"

137
00:17:07,161 --> 00:17:09,141
まさかのチョイスなんですよ自分的に！
it was such an unexpected choice from my perspective!

138
00:17:09,311 --> 00:17:13,281
うわあ、でもね、あのさっきも必死で歌ったんですけど、
Whoa, but, you know, we sang it so desperately earlier,

139
00:17:13,461 --> 00:17:19,371
缶缶さんの声ってさ、もう、やばいですよ本当に！もう恐縮です！
but KANKAN's voice, like, it's seriously amazing! I'm so honored!

140
00:17:19,811 --> 00:17:22,311
で、なんと缶缶さん、
And, what's more, KANKAN,

141
00:17:22,451 --> 00:17:25,711
これも、あの3D初登場じゃないですか！
this is also your first 3D appearance, isn't it?!

142
00:17:25,821 --> 00:17:27,791
そうなんですよ！うわあ！
That's right! Whoa!

143
00:17:27,911 --> 00:17:31,571
もう全部が初めてなんですよ！そう、全部！
Everything is a first! Yes, all of it!

144
00:17:31,781 --> 00:17:32,431
うわあ！
Whoa!

145
00:17:32,481 --> 00:17:35,371
その動きを見せてくださいよ、もう。
Please show us those movements, come on.

146
00:17:35,431 --> 00:17:35,821
うわあ！
Whoa!

147
00:17:35,941 --> 00:17:38,281
3Dどういう感じですか？
How does 3D feel?

148
00:17:38,341 --> 00:17:39,021
缶缶を見ろ！
Look at KANKAN!

149
00:17:39,141 --> 00:17:41,371
どうどうどうどういい？どういう感じ？
How, how, how is it? How does it feel?

150
00:17:41,511 --> 00:17:48,361
えーやっぱりなんか普段はライブ出る時はやっぱ生の身体で出ることが多いんですけど、
Um, well, usually when doing lives, I often appear in my physical body,

151
00:17:48,541 --> 00:17:51,651
やっぱり全然動き方とかも違うし、
but the way we move is completely different,

152
00:17:51,841 --> 00:17:52,361
おお！
Oh!

153
00:17:52,601 --> 00:17:55,731
すべてが新感覚で！おお！
and everything feels like a brand-new sensation! Whoa!

154
00:17:55,871 --> 00:17:57,201
はい、ありがとうございます！
Yes, thank you very much!

155
00:17:57,331 --> 00:17:58,361
いや、素晴らしい！
Yeah, wonderful!

156
00:17:58,481 --> 00:17:59,631
楽しい、め茶苦茶！
It's so much fun!

157
00:17:59,711 --> 00:18:03,231
素晴らしい、3D世界ようこそ！
Wonderful, welcome to the 3D world!

158
00:18:03,351 --> 00:18:07,501
で、あの今回のカイライっていう曲、
And, um, this song "Kairai,"

159
00:18:07,851 --> 00:18:10,981
ていう歌一緒にあの歌ったんですけど、
we sang together,

160
00:18:11,051 --> 00:18:12,751
缶缶さんの売り曲ですよ。
that's KANKAN's signature song.

161
00:18:12,901 --> 00:18:22,541
あ、そうね、私の、はい、yowanecityさんに作っていただきました。素敵な楽曲をぜひ、あの、まあ歌がめちゃくちゃ難しいんですけど、
Ah, right, my, yes, yowanecity-san made it for me. Such a wonderful track, please—well, the singing is extremely difficult,

162
00:18:22,591 --> 00:18:26,571
早口だし詰まってるし、水が大変。
it's fast-paced, packed with lyrics, and staying hydrated is tough.

163
00:18:26,731 --> 00:18:27,451
はい。
Yes.

164
00:18:27,501 --> 00:18:32,511
です。まあちょっと、あの、意味とか曲に関してちょっと聞きたいなって思ってるんですけど、
That's right. Well, I wanted to ask a bit about the meaning and the song, but...

165
00:18:32,641 --> 00:18:44,231
ああもうなんかもうカイライっていうタイトルからしてもう雷がついてるじゃないですか。もうとにかくみんなに稲妻のような衝撃を与えたいっていう気持ちからで、
Ah, well, just from the title "Kairai" alone, it has thunder in it, right? Anyway, it came from the feeling of wanting to give everyone a shock like lightning,

166
00:18:44,601 --> 00:18:47,411
ちょっとオーダーして、
so I placed that order,

167
00:18:47,491 --> 00:18:58,001
ヨーネシティさんに。もうヨーネシティさんならではのやっぱり迫力のある楽曲を作ってもらいたかったので、その結果この素敵な楽曲を作っていただいたんですよ。
to yowanecity-san. I wanted yowanecity-san to create a powerful track with that unique flair, and as a result, they created this wonderful song.

168
00:18:58,151 --> 00:18:59,371
素晴らしい！
Wonderful!

169
00:18:59,531 --> 00:19:08,601
本当に、今後もね、一緒に何かコラボできて本当に、あの、今日、もう言葉出ないやばいどうしよう、
Truly, I hope we can collaborate on something together again in the future, and really, um, today—I'm speechless, oh no, what should I do?

170
00:19:08,711 --> 00:19:11,021
すごい全力で歌ったから、
I sang with all my might, so...

171
00:19:11,211 --> 00:19:14,391
どうしよう。もう、ファン、ファンの気持ちはこういう感じなんだなと思って。
What should I do? I realized this is how a fan's feelings really feel.

172
00:19:14,641 --> 00:19:16,921
いや本当に嬉しいです！
I'm really so happy!

173
00:19:17,061 --> 00:19:24,061
今度一緒に歌ってできたら嬉しいとお願いします！ありがとうございます！
I hope we can sing together again sometime! Thank you very much!

174
00:19:24,261 --> 00:19:30,431
あとみんなもね、あの缶缶さんのチャンネルとかもぜひ見ていてください！
Also everyone, please check out KANKAN's channel as well!

175
00:19:30,511 --> 00:19:32,091
もういっぱい良い曲あるんで！
There are so many good songs!

176
00:19:32,211 --> 00:19:39,171
いや、本当に！もう本当に聞かせていただきます！全ていい曲なんで聞いてください本当に！ぜひよろしくお願いします！
Yes, truly! I'll definitely listen to them! They're all great songs, so please listen to them! Thank you very much!

177
00:19:39,561 --> 00:19:47,961
あと、あの、海外のファンズアズウェル、ディスイズ缶缶。プリーズチェック、プリーズチェック、ゼアチャンネルアウト、ゼエアメイジング！
And also, um, overseas fans as well, this is KANKAN. Please check, please check their channel out, they're amazing!

178
00:19:48,361 --> 00:19:59,611
もう！これ！すごいことですよ！すいません！海外のファンの方も本当に。ビッグファンのお仕事だからプリーズ。
Wow! This! This is amazing! Sorry! Overseas fans too, truly. Since they're a big fan, please...

179
00:20:00,064 --> 00:20:01,152
はい！
Yeah!

180
00:20:01,152 --> 00:20:04,112
もう、あの、もう、これで終わりってわけじゃないけど
It's not like this is the end yet, though...

181
00:20:04,232 --> 00:20:06,872
はい、もうね、時間があるからね
Yeah, we still have time!

182
00:20:08,092 --> 00:20:09,132
いやだ！
No way!

183
00:20:09,532 --> 00:20:11,772
また今度しましょう！
Let's do this again sometime!

184
00:20:11,332 --> 00:20:12,752
ぜひ！ぜひよろしくお願いします！
Yes! Please invite me again!

185
00:20:12,952 --> 00:20:14,272
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

186
00:20:14,272 --> 00:20:16,032
ありがとうございました！
Thank you so much!

187
00:20:15,572 --> 00:20:17,032
お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Happy birthday!

188
00:20:16,872 --> 00:20:17,872
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

189
00:20:18,452 --> 00:20:20,032
皆さんありがとうございました！楽しかったです！
Thank you everyone! That was so fun!

190
00:20:20,152 --> 00:20:22,032
ありがとうございました！バイバイドス！
Thank you! Bye-bye!

191
00:20:22,872 --> 00:20:24,232
I'm so sad...

192
00:20:24,232 --> 00:20:26,032
But the show must continue!

193
00:20:26,572 --> 00:20:29,832
こっからまだ続きやって、見ててね！
We're going to keep going from here, so keep watching!

194
00:20:30,232 --> 00:20:32,032
はい、オッケーです。行きます。
Alright, okay. Let's go.

195
00:20:43,132 --> 00:20:47,532
[Title: 宵々古今] [Lyrics: Reol Music: Giga, Reol]

196
00:20:55,252 --> 00:21:00,672
らっしゃいな 平は成り 時が来た 正しい夢現 夜もすがら
Welcome, peace is established; the time has come, a true dream-reality all night long.

197
00:21:01,852 --> 00:21:07,532
変わりゆくことに恐れなし のっぴきならないのは御免
No fear in changing; I refuse to be caught in a bind.

198
00:21:08,532 --> 00:21:13,652
手毬唄歌い 君達が誘う
Singing handball songs, you invite me.

199
00:21:14,232 --> 00:21:18,832
悪人に後ろ髪を惹かれても 進むべきなり
Even if reluctant to leave villains behind, I must press onward.

200
00:21:21,112 --> 00:21:26,652
流行り廃りの憂き世なら 信ずる者はただ、君だけと
If this floating world is filled with passing trends, the only one I believe in is you.

201
00:21:33,252 --> 00:21:46,432
踊れ騒げや 呑めや歌えや 案ずることなどないな 此の世人の世は恨めしい 雪駄はちゃらちゃら 愛し 縋って眩んで満身創痍で
Dance and make a ruckus, drink and sing; there's nothing to worry about. This human world is resentful, zori sandals clattering lovingly, clinging, dazzled, covered in wounds...

202
00:21:47,332 --> 00:22:02,032
今を嘆いて昔を粧しても 君の心の内 流る涙川 それじゃ敵わん 何処にいても めくるめく舞台に君を連れて
Even if you lament the present and put on airs about the past, the river of tears flowing inside your heart—that won't do. No matter where you are, I'll take you to the dazzling stage.

203
00:22:13,912 --> 00:22:22,032
あまりてなどか人ぞ悲しき 身勝手なのが世の理か 万人持つ理想 虚像の偶像 俗な答えなどはあらざらむ
Why is man so sorrowful? Is selfishness the logic of the world? Ideals held by all, illusions of idols, there can be no vulgar answers.

204
00:22:22,532 --> 00:22:27,532
僕ら巡りあうこと まさに一期一会
Our meeting each other is truly a once-in-a-lifetime encounter.

205
00:22:33,132 --> 00:22:44,232
酸いも甘いも試練 連れ添ってこの手握って 生きづらい此処、浮き世から 旗を掲げよ 宵闇が明く
Through trials of bitter and sweet, accompanying each other and gripping this hand, from this hard-to-live floating world, let's raise our banner as the twilight clears!

206
00:23:11,232 --> 00:23:18,532
彩る色 何処までも 空前なる見晴らしを眺めて
Colors adorning everywhere, gazing out at an unprecedented view.

207
00:23:21,032 --> 00:23:26,532
負けて花一匁 欲しがる欲しがる欲しがる声
Losing at hana-ichimonme, voices wanting, wanting, wanting.

208
00:23:27,032 --> 00:23:33,232
勝って恨んで買って選んで 呆気ないって泣いて 猿真似の何番煎じじゃ満ち足りないない
Winning, resenting, buying, choosing, crying that it's fleeting—rehashed ape mimicry isn't enough!

209
00:23:38,032 --> 00:23:45,532
未だ進む道半ば哉 如何なる時も歩を前へ出せ
Still halfway along our path, at any time put your step forward.

210
00:23:46,832 --> 00:23:52,532
流行り廃りの憂き世なら 信ずる者はただ、君だけと
If this floating world is filled with passing trends, the only one I believe in is you.

211
00:23:59,832 --> 00:24:12,032
踊れ騒げや 呑めや歌えや 案ずることなどないな 此の世人の世は恨めしい 雪駄はちゃらちゃら 愛し 縋って眩んで満身創痍で
Dance and make a ruckus, drink and sing; there's nothing to worry about. This human world is resentful, zori sandals clattering lovingly, clinging, dazzled, covered in wounds...

212
00:24:13,832 --> 00:24:27,532
今を嘆いて昔を粧しても 君の心の内 流る涙川 それじゃ敵わん 何処にいても めくるめく舞台は宵々、君を連れて
Even if you lament the present and put on airs about the past, the river of tears flowing inside your heart—that won't do. No matter where you are, taking you to the dazzling, twilight stage.

213
00:24:43,032 --> 00:24:55,032
あまりてなどか人ぞ恋しき 身勝手なのが世の理か 移ろうは古今 航路なら堂々 恐るることなどはあらざらむ
Why is man so yearning? Is selfishness the logic of the world? Things shift through all ages; if our course is grand, there is nothing to fear.

214
00:25:13,798 --> 00:25:21,358
この命を捧げる運命なら 抗うものは幼い頃に失くした
If it is my fate to offer up this life, those who opposed me were lost in my childhood—

215
00:25:21,458 --> 00:25:30,458
父と母が残したその眼差しは 心の呪いとなる 憎しみが争いを争いが哀しみを
The gazes left behind by father and mother become curses of the heart. Hatred turns to conflict, conflict turns to sorrow...

216
00:25:30,898 --> 00:25:41,498
輪廻のように世界をかき乱すなら 小さなこの命に 生きる意味をあなたが宿したんだ
If we are to stir up the world like samsara, you instilled the meaning of life into this small life.

217
00:25:45,378 --> 00:25:50,098
紛い物同士、運命の賽は投げられた 願わくば最期まで
Imposters both, the die of fate is cast. May it be so until the very end,

218
00:25:52,838 --> 00:26:02,358
この思いを、この心を あなたに捧げるのなら 慰めも 憐みも いらないから
If I am to offer these feelings and this heart to you, I need neither comfort nor pity.

219
00:26:06,918 --> 00:26:17,438
この誓いを、この運命を あなたが望むのならば 苦しみも、悲しみも 抱きしめるから
If you desire this vow and this fate, I will embrace both the pain and the sorrow.

220
00:26:19,038 --> 00:26:21,438
抱きしめるから
I will embrace them...

221
00:26:42,318 --> 00:26:51,398
喝采を浴びるのは人成らざる異形の王 月光に隠れるのは人の形成す者
Bathed in applause is the non-human, grotesque king; hiding in the moonlight are those who form humanity.

222
00:26:51,398 --> 00:26:54,718
紛い物同士、運命の賽は投げられた 願わくば最期まで
Imposters both, the die of fate is cast. May it be so until the very end,

223
00:26:55,278 --> 00:27:01,398
その瞳を
those eyes...

224
00:27:07,458 --> 00:27:21,418
この命を、この世界を あなたが受け入れるなら 憎しみも 哀しみも いらないから
If you accept this life and this world, I need neither hatred nor sorrow.

225
00:27:22,058 --> 00:27:31,458
この思いを、この心を あなたに捧げるのなら その命を響かせて
If I am to offer these feelings and this heart to you, let that life resonate.

226
00:27:32,458 --> 00:27:44,778
この誓いを、この運命を あなたが望むのならば 苦しみも、悲しみも 抱きしめるから
If you desire this vow and this fate, I will embrace both the pain and the sorrow.

227
00:27:48,058 --> 00:27:53,058
抱きしめるから
I will embrace them...

228
00:28:31,452 --> 00:28:37,512
ホントつまらねぇと言ってやるよこの場で 当たり障りなくしてハズレさえも欠いた賭博など
I'll tell you right here that it's truly boring, playing it safe in a gamble lacking even a miss—

229
00:28:37,512 --> 00:28:41,852
そうずっと変わらないでずっと変わり続ける 懲りずに媚びずカマす それがやっぱカッコいいだろ
Yes, staying forever unchanged while ever-changing, never learning, never pandering, just pulling it off—that's what's cool after all.

230
00:28:42,212 --> 00:28:44,512
それがやっぱカッコいいだろ
That's what's cool after all!

231
00:28:57,212 --> 00:29:03,012
無礼非常識な言葉でステージ上で沸かすだけ 頭の中にこびり付いて取れねぇ景色見せるだけ
Just hyping up the stage with rude, outrageous words, showing you sights that stick in your head and won't come off.

232
00:29:03,212 --> 00:29:08,872
獣並みの毛並みも並じゃないけど 何者より高く波に乗る 舐めないで欲しいぜ
Though my beast-like coat is extraordinary, I ride the waves higher than anyone else—don't underestimate me.

233
00:29:09,652 --> 00:29:15,972
ネットはさながら風呂場の延長 データの洪水且つ日々炎上 石川みたいに身を入り洗浄
The internet is like an extension of the bathhouse, a flood of data catching fire daily, purifying ourselves body and soul like Ishikawa...

234
00:29:19,532 --> 00:29:22,132
一生戦場
A lifelong battlefield—

235
00:29:22,132 --> 00:29:28,212
このまま行こう どんな甘いも酸いも全部かっ食らって見せるぜ
Let's keep going this way—I'll devour every sweet and sour thing and show you!

236
00:29:28,912 --> 00:29:35,412
このまま行こう どんな不安や不満に不意に面食らっても 錆びた鎖じゃ意味はなさず
Let's keep going this way—even if sudden anxiety or dissatisfaction catches us off guard, rusted chains hold no meaning.

237
00:29:40,892 --> 00:29:46,892
首元光らせギンギラギンにありのまま行く
Letting our necklaces gleam, going just as we are, dazzlingly bright!

238
00:29:54,532 --> 00:30:00,012
そう俺は見せるだけだ 富と名声を得る過程 出禁食らう程に下品に円を貯めるエンタメ
I'm just showing you the process of gaining wealth and fame, vulgar entertainment that gets me banned from venues while hoarding yen.

239
00:30:00,364 --> 00:30:01,884
ためらう暇などないのよ
There's no time to hesitate.

240
00:30:01,964 --> 00:30:05,784
目に物見せるためmoneyをmore 誰かさんが何をどう口挟んでも
To show them with money to more, no matter what anyone says or how they try to butt in.

241
00:30:05,864 --> 00:30:07,204
幕を上げろ明日よ晴れろ
Raise the curtain, let tomorrow be clear!

242
00:30:07,384 --> 00:30:08,584
我が身を投じる
Throwing oneself into it,

243
00:30:08,584 --> 00:30:10,324
場所なら絶対
the place is absolute!

244
00:30:10,644 --> 00:30:13,564
今この場所この舞台で決定
Decided right here on this stage.

245
00:30:14,124 --> 00:30:16,944
五右衛門みたいにかなかな絶景
Like Goemon, a magnificent view.

246
00:30:17,184 --> 00:30:19,504
向かい風吹いたって
Even if a headwind blows!

247
00:30:21,184 --> 00:30:23,064
逆に乗りこなしてやるぜ
I'll turn it around and ride it out!

248
00:30:23,064 --> 00:30:25,184
俺にとっちゃこれが常で
To me, this has always been the norm—

249
00:30:25,184 --> 00:30:27,184
言葉が出せぬくらい暗い時代なんて言うけど
they call it a dark era where words fail us, but...

250
00:30:27,184 --> 00:30:30,184
だけど見してやる ぶちカマしてやる
I'll show you and blow it all away!

251
00:30:30,344 --> 00:30:35,444
俺は小せぇし品性も姿勢も知んねぇが チンケな規制や時勢に背きバカでけぇ事やろうぜ
I may be small and lack decorum or posture, but defying petty rules and times, let's do something ridiculously bold!

252
00:30:36,598 --> 00:30:39,998
このまま行こう
Let's keep going just like this.

253
00:30:40,098 --> 00:30:43,398
どんな甘いも酸いも全部かっ食らって見せるぜ
I'll devour all the sweetness and bitterness and show you!

254
00:30:43,698 --> 00:30:46,398
このまま行こう
Let's keep going just like this.

255
00:30:46,398 --> 00:30:49,598
どんな不安や不満に不意に面食らっても
No matter what anxiety or dissatisfaction suddenly takes us aback,

256
